</div>
<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Health & sports studies.</p>
<a href="https://www.lunex.lu" target="_blank" class="apply">Apply</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Luxembourg School of Business</h3>
<div class="info-line">
<span>📍 <a class="map-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps?q=LSB" target="_blank">Lux City</a></span>
