<a href="https://www.lsb.lu" target="_blank" class="apply">Apply</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>ESSCA</h3>
<div class="info-line">
<span>📍 <a class="map-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps?q=ESSCA+Luxembourg" target="_blank">Lux City</a></span>
<span>Type: Business</span>
<span>Language: EN</span>
