<a href="https://www.essca.fr/en/" target="_blank" class="apply">Apply</a>
</div>

</div>

<!-- ================= NETHERLANDS ================= -->
<div id="nl" class="tab">
<h2>🇳🇱 Universities in Netherlands (English)</h2>

<div class="card">
<h3>University of Amsterdam <span class="badge">⭐ Best Choice</span></h3>
<div class="info-line">
